B.RR=new A.S(B.t,["Formation of INC (1885)","Founded by A.O. Hume. Moderate phase (1885-1905) led by Dadabhai Naoroji, G.K. Gokhale. Demand for constitutional reforms and economic critique (Drain Theory).",""],t.w)
B.So=new A.S(B.t,["Extremist Phase & Swadeshi (1905-1917)","Partition of Bengal (Curzon, 1905). Lal-Bal-Pal. Swadeshi and Boycott movement. Surat Split (1907). Morley-Minto Reforms (1909) and separate electorates.",""],t.w)
B.Sa=new A.S(B.t,["Gandhian Era Begins","Gandhi returns (1915). Champaran (1917), Kheda (1918), Ahmedabad Mill Strike. Rowlatt Act and Jallianwala Bagh Massacre (1919).",""],t.w)
B.Sm=new A.S(B.t,["Non-Cooperation & Khilafat (1920-22)","Boycott of schools, courts, foreign goods. Surrender of titles. Chauri Chaura incident (1922) led to withdrawal.",""],t.w)
B.Sl=new A.S(B.t,["Civil Disobedience Movement","Simon Commission (1927), Nehru Report (1928), Lahore Session (1929 - Purna Swaraj). Dandi March (1930) and Salt Satyagraha. Round Table Conferences. Gandhi-Irwin Pact (1931).",""],t.w)
B.Sv=new A.S(B.t,["Revolutionary Nationalism","Bhagat Singh, Chandrashekhar Azad (HSRA). Surya Sen (Chittagong Armoury Raid). Kakori Conspiracy.",""],t.w)
B.SH=new A.S(B.t,["Quit India Movement (1942)","Failure of Cripps Mission. Gowalia Tank, Bombay. 'Do or Die'. Parallel governments in Ballia, Tamluk, Satara.",""],t.w)
B.RX=new A.S(B.t,["Towards Freedom & Partition","INA and Subhas Chandra Bose. Cabinet Mission Plan (1946). Direct Action Day. Mountbatten Plan (June 3 Plan). Indian Independence Act 1947.",""],t.w)
