B.Sx=new A.S(B.t,["Inflation and Business Cycles","Types: Creeping, Galloping, Hyperinflation. Causes: Demand-pull, Cost-push. Measurement: WPI vs CPI. Impact of inflation. Phillips Curve.",""],t.w)
